code: 0
--- stdout
The approved change goes out

  From:      any status
  To:        Done; an issue already there keeps it, so a repeat is safe
  Needs:     the label approved on the issue; refused (exit code 2) without it: ask the user
             approve adds it
  Refused:   while the issue has the label parked (exit code 2): ask the user
             unpark removes it
  Requires:  nothing besides the issue number
  Board:     adds the issue if it is not there

Usage:
  gh dojo ship <N> [flags]

Flags:
      --dry-run   print the plan without changing anything
  -h, --help      help for ship
      --show      also print the issue's card, as gh dojo show N does, from the same read

Global Flags:
  -q, --jq expression       filter the JSON with a jq expression (implies --json)
      --json                print the result as JSON (schema_version 1), errors too
  -t, --template template   format the JSON with a Go template (implies --json)
--- stderr
